.Dd 2025-09-30
.Dt EVP_SM3 3ossl
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm EVP_sm3
.Nd SM3 for EVP
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In openssl/evp.h
.Ft const EVP_MD *
.Fo EVP_sm3
.Fa void
.Fc
.Sh DESCRIPTION
SM3 is a cryptographic hash function with a 256-bit output, defined in
GB/T 32905-2016.
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It EVP_sm3()
The SM3 hash function.
.El
.Sh NOTES
Developers should be aware of the negative performance implications of
calling this function multiple times and should consider using
.Xr EVP_MD_fetch 3
with
.Xr EVP_MD-SM3 7
instead.
See
.Xr crypto 7
for further information.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
These functions return a
.Sy EVP_MD
structure that contains the implementation of the message digest.
See
.Xr EVP_MD_meth_new 3
for details of the
.Sy EVP_MD
structure.
.Sh CONFORMING TO
GB/T 32905-2016 and GM/T 0004-2012.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr evp 7 ,
.Xr EVP_DigestInit 3
